<style>
  .root {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20;
    gap: 8;
    background-color: rgba(0, 8, 20, 0.94);
    border-radius: 14;
    width: 420;
    border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.4);
    border-width: 2;
  }
  .title {
    font-size: 22;
    color: #00ffff;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 14;
    color: #ffaa00;
  }
  .tip {
    font-size: 11;
    color: rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.8);
  }
  .divider {
    width: 380;
    height: 1;
    background-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }
  .btn {
    padding: 8;
    background-color: rgba(0, 150, 200, 0.15);
    border-radius: 8;
    width: 200;
    align-items: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-color: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-width: 1;
  }
  .btn-text {
    font-size: 14;
    color: #00ffff;
  }
</style>
<Panel class="root">
  <div class="title">HOW TO PLAY</div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="section-title">KEYBOARD</div>
  <div class="tip">WASD / Arrows - Move ship</div>
  <div class="tip">Q / E - Aim cannons</div>
  <div class="tip">Space / F - Fire cannons</div>
  <div class="tip">Shift - Dash (dodge)</div>
  <div class="tip">R - Fire harpoon (pulls enemies)</div>
  <div class="tip">ESC / P - Pause</div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="section-title">VR CONTROLLERS</div>
  <div class="tip">Left Stick - Move ship</div>
  <div class="tip">Right Stick - Aim cannons</div>
  <div class="tip">Right Trigger - Fire</div>
  <div class="tip">A Button - Dash</div>
  <div class="tip">B Button - Harpoon</div>
  <div class="tip">Right Grip - Pause</div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="section-title">TIPS</div>
  <div class="tip">Sink ships to earn gold and score</div>
  <div class="tip">Collect floating treasure chests</div>
  <div class="tip">Upgrade at the harbor between waves</div>
  <div class="tip">Chain kills for combo multiplier</div>
  <div class="tip">Watch for sea mines and whirlpools</div>
  <div class="tip">Collect power-ups from the sea</div>
  <div class="tip">Harpoon pulls enemies closer for easy hits</div>
  <div class="tip">Boss appears every 5th wave</div>
  <div class="tip">KRAKEN rises every 10th wave!</div>
  <div class="divider"></div>
  <div class="btn" id="btn-tutorial-back">
    <div class="btn-text">BACK</div>
  </div>
</Panel>
